    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(6th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Noise:</strong> +1</p><p>You establish a controlled enforcement zone.</p><p>Create a defined area where escalation becomes expensive for the duration of the scene.</p><p>Within the zone:</p><ul><li><p>Violent escalation may impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2,</p></li><li><p>Manifesting may require additional cost,</p></li><li><p>Divine or extraplanar abilities strain or destabilize.</p></li></ul><h3>Cost</h3><p>Spend 1 Surge to establish.</p><h3>Interaction</h3><p>Targets marked Out of Compliance suffer increased penalties inside the zone.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Quarantine zones attract attention from authorities, sponsors, and rival mandates.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
